<title>CANADA: Loewen raises semi-annual dividend.</title>
<headline>Loewen raises semi-annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loewen Group Inc said on Thursday it raised its semi-annual dividend to US$0.08 a share from US$0.07.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable January 21 to shareholders of record January 7.</p>
<p>Loewen, a Canadian-based funeral home operator, has been fighting a hostile US$2.9 billion takeover bid from Service Corp International.</p>
<p>Loewen last raised its dividend in June to US$0.07 from US$0.05.</p>
<p>(( -- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
